## Scope and compliance notes

This project is a **clean-room reimplementation of observable behaviour**, written to
interoperate with standard serial / Modbus devices. It is not affiliated with, endorsed
by, or derived from the source code of any commercial serial-monitor product.

* No code, icons, strings or other assets were copied from third-party software.
* Protocol behaviour (Modbus RTU/ASCII/TCP) follows the public Modbus specification.
* The UI layout was studied from publicly observable behaviour for interoperability and
  usability parity; all implementation is original.

Names of third-party products are used only for factual reference (e.g. describing a
file format they produce) and remain the trademarks of their respective owners.

If you intend to redistribute a **built binary** that includes the kernel driver, your
own code-signing certificate is required; the test certificate used locally must not be
shipped (see `.gitignore` and `docs/签名与认证方案.md`).

## Security

See `SECURITY.md` for how to report a vulnerability.
